    "body": "## SUPERSEDED — AUTONOMOUS COMMUNICATION / DAEMON PATH RETIRED\n\nCurrent `main@9e2f6309e3aa452c42b859eaa515641fea7e3f09` retires the local production-controller entrypoint (#259) and old comment/executor ingress (#263). #251 is the only product NEXT router at P01. The daemon + Reference Bridge architecture in this umbrella is therefore not a current execution path and must not be revived as infrastructure work.\n\nDisposition: close `SUPERSEDED / HISTORICAL ARCHITECTURE`. Preserve prior evidence; no current OWNER-PC daemon state is claimed.",
